# Floor plan assignment

- Three input tiers: photos, video, LiDAR. All are pass targets. One FloorPlan IR: `docs/schemas/floorplan.schema.json`.
- Linux Cloud Agents cannot run Apple RoomPlan. Ingest JSON/USDZ/PLY exports.
- Photos emit **centimetres** with calibrated `error_interval` (official ±8% wall gate). Do not use `units: relative` as the graded output. Do not pre-concede opening/ceiling gates.
- Prefer classical geometry over an LLM that guesses **dimensions**. An LLM **with tools** is required for damage/scope (`docs/agent-layer.md`).
- Disclosed public LLM API allowed. Do not call our servers. Fallback if the key is missing.
- ESX/Xactimate export is out of scope unless `docs/takehome.md` requires it.
- Do not build a website. Route 1 iOS app is in-scope until `docs/cut-later.md`.
- Tests must run headless (`opencv-python-headless`).
- Score policy: max every official row; cut only tomorrow night.
